      "sourceTextSha256": "302a0afab6f19e566634c1f8e4aee6ef2f986b854533589df44247ba875a3472",
      "text": "Day 5 · For guests in good shape, a trek through the forest to a Cabécar indigenous village, whose people maintain much of their traditional way of life. Members of this village helped build the first lodge on the Pacuare, and some still work at the lodge, hiking to and from their village each day. Overnight at Ríos Tropicales Lodge. (B, L, D)",
